{
 "examples": [
  {
   "name": "Default",
   "summary": "The compound API: build the table by hand from `<Table.Header>` / `<Table.Row>` / `<Table.HeadCell>` / `<Table.Cell>`. The result is an ordinary table — the same as the data-driven API — but you control every cell. Reach for it when a cell needs custom content; otherwise prefer `:data` + `:columns`.",
   "sfc": "<script setup>\n  import Table from '@aziontech/webkit/table'\n\n  const items = [\n    { id: '1001', name: 'Workload Alpha', status: 'Active', editor: 'user1@example.com' },\n    { id: '1002', name: 'Workload Bravo', status: 'Inactive', editor: 'user2@example.com' },\n    { id: '1003', name: 'Workload Charlie', status: 'Degraded', editor: 'user3@example.com' },\n    { id: '1004', name: 'Workload Delta', status: 'Active', editor: 'user4@example.com' },\n    { id: '1005', name: 'Workload Echo', status: 'Inactive', editor: 'user5@example.com' }\n  ]\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <Table bordered>\n    <Table.Header>\n      <Table.Row>\n        <Table.HeadCell principal>Name</Table.HeadCell>\n        <Table.HeadCell>Status</Table.HeadCell>\n        <Table.HeadCell>Last Editor</Table.HeadCell>\n      </Table.Row>\n    </Table.Header>\n    <Table.Body>\n      <Table.Row\n        v-for=\"item in items\"\n        :key=\"item.id\"\n      >\n        <Table.Cell principal\n          ><span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 truncate\">{{ item.name }}</span></Table.Cell\n        >\n        <Table.Cell\n          ><span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 truncate\">{{ item.status }}</span></Table.Cell\n        >\n        <Table.Cell\n          ><span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 truncate\">{{ item.editor }}</span></Table.Cell\n        >\n      </Table.Row>\n    </Table.Body>\n  </Table>\n</template>"
  },
  {
   "name": "CellPresets",
   "summary": "The cell presets every list shares: `Table.CellLink` for a name that opens another screen (tooltip names the destination), for a repository with its provider glyph before the name (`icon=\"ai ai-github\"`, muted and outside the link) and for a domain with its `+N` overflow and a copy button pinned to the end edge, `Table.CellId` with a copy button, `Table.CellStatus` (one semantic chip per row), `Table.CellTags` showing as many tags as fit, `Table.CellTime` (avatar plus relative time counted from the `WebkitProvider`'s fixed `now`, the absolute time on the tooltip and for screen readers) and `Table.CellActions` (the row menu named after the row).",
   "sfc": "<script setup>\n  import DataTable from '@aziontech/webkit/data-table'\n  import DropdownMenu from '@aziontech/webkit/dropdown-menu'\n  import Table from '@aziontech/webkit/table'\n  import WebkitProvider from '@aziontech/webkit/webkit-provider'\n\n  const HOUR = 3_600_000\n  const NOW = Date.UTC(2026, 10, 10, 12)\n\n  const statusSeverity = (status) =>\n    ({ Active: 'success', Failed: 'danger', Pending: 'warning' })[status] ?? 'neutral'\n\n  const rows = [\n    {\n      id: '1726504',\n      name: 'storefront',\n      repository: 'example/storefront',\n      status: 'Active',\n      domains: ['shop.example.com', 'www.shop.example.com', 'm.shop.example.com'],\n      tags: ['production', 'checkout', 'payments', 'europe'],\n      updatedAt: new Date(NOW - 2 * HOUR),\n      updatedBy: 'jane.doe@example.com'\n    },\n    {\n      id: '1726511',\n      name: 'image-optimizer',\n      repository: 'example/image-optimizer',\n      status: 'Pending',\n      domains: ['img.example.com'],\n      tags: ['media'],\n      updatedAt: new Date(NOW - 26 * HOUR),\n      updatedBy: 'jonas.weber@example.com'\n    },\n    {\n      id: '1726530',\n      name: 'docs-portal',\n      repository: '',\n      status: 'Failed',\n      domains: ['docs.example.com', 'help.example.com'],\n      tags: [],\n      updatedAt: new Date(NOW - 9 * 24 * HOUR),\n      updatedBy: 'john.smith@example.com'\n    }\n  ]\n\n  const columns = [\n    { accessorKey: 'name', header: 'Name', principal: true },\n    { accessorKey: 'id', header: 'ID', minWidth: 140 },\n    { accessorKey: 'repository', header: 'Repository', grow: 2 },\n    { accessorKey: 'status', header: 'Status', minWidth: 96 },\n    { accessorKey: 'domains', header: 'Domain', grow: 2 },\n    { accessorKey: 'tags', header: 'Tags', grow: 2 },\n    { accessorKey: 'updatedAt', header: 'Last modified', minWidth: 160 },\n    { id: 'actions', kind: 'action', hideable: false }\n  ]\n\n  const onAction = (_event, _value, _row) => {}\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <WebkitProvider :now=\"NOW\">\n    <DataTable\n      :data=\"rows\"\n      :columns=\"columns\"\n      row-key=\"id\"\n      aria-label=\"Workloads\"\n    >\n      <template #cell-name=\"{ row }\">\n        <Table.CellLink\n          :label=\"row.name\"\n          :to=\"`/workloads/${row.id}`\"\n          destination=\"Workloads\"\n        />\n      </template>\n      <template #cell-id=\"{ value }\">\n        <Table.CellId\n          :value=\"value\"\n          resource=\"workload\"\n        />\n      </template>\n      <template #cell-repository=\"{ value }\">\n        <Table.CellLink\n          v-if=\"value\"\n          icon=\"ai ai-github\"\n          :label=\"value\"\n          :href=\"`https://github.com/${value}`\"\n        />\n        <span\n          v-else\n          class=\"text-body-sm text-(--text-muted)\"\n          >—</span\n        >\n      </template>\n      <template #cell-status=\"{ value }\">\n        <Table.CellStatus\n          :label=\"value\"\n          :severity=\"statusSeverity(value)\"\n        />\n      </template>\n      <template #cell-domains=\"{ row }\">\n        <Table.CellLink\n          :label=\"row.domains[0]\"\n          :href=\"`https://${row.domains[0]}`\"\n          :more=\"row.domains.slice(1).map((label) => ({ label, href: `https://${label}` }))\"\n          :noun=\"{ one: 'domain', other: 'domains' }\"\n          copyable\n        />\n      </template>\n      <template #cell-tags=\"{ value }\">\n        <Table.CellTags :items=\"value\" />\n      </template>\n      <template #cell-updatedAt=\"{ row }\">\n        <Table.CellTime\n          :value=\"row.updatedAt\"\n          :author=\"row.updatedBy\"\n        />\n      </template>\n      <template #header-actions>\n        <span class=\"sr-only\">Actions</span>\n      </template>\n      <template #cell-actions=\"{ row }\">\n        <Table.CellActions\n          :name=\"row.name\"\n          @select=\"(event, value) => onAction(event, value, row)\"\n        >\n          <DropdownMenu.Group>\n            <DropdownMenu.Item\n              value=\"edit\"\n              label=\"Edit\"\n            />\n            <DropdownMenu.Item\n              value=\"clone\"\n              label=\"Clone\"\n            />\n          </DropdownMenu.Group>\n          <DropdownMenu.Group>\n            <DropdownMenu.Item\n              value=\"delete\"\n              label=\"Delete\"\n            />\n          </DropdownMenu.Group>\n        </Table.CellActions>\n      </template>\n    </DataTable>\n  </WebkitProvider>\n</template>"
  }
 ]
}
